            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">Акт на списание инвентаря и хозяйственных принадлежностей</h2><div class="doc-snippet">   Понадобится при составлении акта на списание инвентаря и хозяйственных принадлежностей  </div><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasx1cbg6/" data-dfa="dfasx1cbg6"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas75194b/" data-dfa="dfas75194b"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfask0moo0/" data-dfa="dfask0moo0"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.56%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfaszlogne/" data-dfa="dfaszlogne"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 6.91%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas6wirdm/" data-dfa="dfas6wirdm"></a></td><td colspan="4" style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 52%;"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr1/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas8r8xd2/" data-dfa="dfas8r8xd2"></a><strong>«У&nbsp;Т&nbsp;В&nbsp;Е&nbsp;Р&nbsp;Ж&nbsp;Д&nbsp;А&nbsp;Ю»</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas579g2w/" data-dfa="dfas579g2w"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasddlgsg/" data-dfa="dfasddlgsg"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas40y4m7/" data-dfa="dfas40y4m7"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.56%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasqm9v0c/" data-dfa="dfasqm9v0c"></a></td><td colspan="5" style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 58%;"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr2/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas5b0hhx/" data-dfa="dfas5b0hhx"></a>Директор</p></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas08nwrh/" data-dfa="dfas08nwrh"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas4kknnx/" data-dfa="dfas4kknnx"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasyb8bby/" data-dfa="dfasyb8bby"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.56%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasxdplmc/" data-dfa="dfasxdplmc"></a></td><td colspan="5" style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 58%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr3/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasr04e13/" data-dfa="dfasr04e13"></a>О.О. </span>Азизов </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas6itw45/" data-dfa="dfas6itw45"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasc8gm9i/" data-dfa="dfasc8gm9i"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasv499h6/" data-dfa="dfasv499h6"></a></td><td style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.56%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasz3y1e1/" data-dfa="dfasz3y1e1"></a></td><td colspan="5" style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 58%;"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasupp5r8/" data-dfa="dfasupp5r8"></a>"<span class="fill">29</span>" <span class="fill">июля </span><span class="fill"><year>2026</year></span>&nbsp;г.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="height: 19.95px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 100%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasg0900m/" data-dfa="dfasg0900m"></a><strong>АКТ<span id="sfwc_1" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print">Если инвентарь пришел в&nbsp;негодность, спишите его на&nbsp;основании <span num="3" lnktype="intlnk" title="" class="doc">акта</span>. Для этого можно создать собственный документ. Формы актов утвердите в <span num="4" lnktype="intlnk" title="" class="doc">учетной политике</span> предприятия.<br>Подробнее: «<span num="5" lnktype="intlnk" title="" class="doc">Как оформить и&nbsp;учесть инвентарь и&nbsp;хозяйственные принадлежност</span>»и"</span></span><br>На&nbsp;списание инвентаря и&nbsp;хозяйственных принадлежностей</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="height: 63.84px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 100%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasgf9nei/" data-dfa="dfasgf9nei"></a>Комиссия в&nbsp;составе <span class="fill">зам директора <span class="fill">А.А. </span>Ахмедова, материального бухгалтера <span class="fill">И.И. </span>Саидовой, зав. хозяйством <span class="fill"> К.К. </span>Равшанова, начальника цеха №&nbsp;1 <span class="fill">И.П. </span>Нигматуллаева </span> составила настоящий акт в&nbsp;том, что ниже перечисленные товарно-материальные ценности списаны с&nbsp;материально-ответственного <span class="fill">начальника цеха №&nbsp;1 <span class="fill">И.П. </span>Нигматуллаева </span>в&nbsp;связи с&nbsp;истечением срока эксплуатации.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas242pz0/" data-dfa="dfas242pz0"></a></td><td class="bdBottom" style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas5dh9an/" data-dfa="dfas5dh9an"></a></td><td class="bdBottom" style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas9stfl8/" data-dfa="dfas9stfl8"></a></td><td class="bdBottom" style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.56%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfast8l9eo/" data-dfa="dfast8l9eo"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 6.91%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasdx080s/" data-dfa="dfasdx080s"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 10.75%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas1ilkhx/" data-dfa="dfas1ilkhx"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.36%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasrl5lm6/" data-dfa="dfasrl5lm6"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 11.88%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas0wlily/" data-dfa="dfas0wlily"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 20.26%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasevcsiq/" data-dfa="dfasevcsiq"></a></td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 5%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasuox8vn/" data-dfa="dfasuox8vn"></a><strong>№ п/п</strong></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" colspan="3" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 35%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasgximch/" data-dfa="dfasgximch"></a><strong>Наименование материала</strong></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 6.91%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasgy1gl2/" data-dfa="dfasgy1gl2"></a><strong>Ед. изм.</strong></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 10.75%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasgwn8y5/" data-dfa="dfasgwn8y5"></a><strong>Кол-во</strong></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 12.36%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasi5d7b9/" data-dfa="dfasi5d7b9"></a><strong>Цена, сум</strong></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 11.88%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasrerp80/" data-dfa="dfasrerp80"></a><strong>Сумма, сум</strong></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; width: 20.26%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasxyqnzc/" data-dfa="dfasxyqnzc"></a><strong>Структурное подразделение</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasw7ru4q/" data-dfa="dfasw7ru4q"></a>1</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" colspan="3" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 35%;"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas9g91v4/" data-dfa="dfas9g91v4"></a>Инструмент слесарный</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 6.91%;"><p style="text-align:center"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasu1e76d/" data-dfa="dfasu1e76d"></a>к-т</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 10.75%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfaskvgbwb/" data-dfa="dfaskvgbwb"></a>3,00</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.36%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas9s9hg4/" data-dfa="dfas9s9hg4"></a>1&nbsp;000 000,00</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 11.88%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasbxpgzq/" data-dfa="dfasbxpgzq"></a>3&nbsp;000 000,00</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 20.26%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasphv3wr/" data-dfa="dfasphv3wr"></a>Цех №&nbsp;1</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasxg0urn/" data-dfa="dfasxg0urn"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight" colspan="4" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 42%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasi7l8gm/" data-dfa="dfasi7l8gm"></a><strong>ИТОГО</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 10.75%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasfx1k6b/" data-dfa="dfasfx1k6b"></a>3,00</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.36%;"><p style="text-align:center"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasroq7o5/" data-dfa="dfasroq7o5"></a>х</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 11.88%;"><p style="text-align:right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasf9hxiv/" data-dfa="dfasf9hxiv"></a>3&nbsp;000 000,00</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight" style="height: 20.9475px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 20.26%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasd1vm70/" data-dfa="dfasd1vm70"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasq29gwp/" data-dfa="dfasq29gwp"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas1xaa1d/" data-dfa="dfas1xaa1d"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 5.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfas204son/" data-dfa="dfas204son"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.56%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasmsafml/" data-dfa="dfasmsafml"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 6.91%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasqbdkst/" data-dfa="dfasqbdkst"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 10.75%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasx02v03/" data-dfa="dfasx02v03"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 12.36%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/200612/dfasr5t8y9/" data-dfa="dfasr5t8y9"></a></td><td style="height: 11.97px; vertical-align